break: anywhere;\">\udc17𐠡\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802𐠕\udc13𐠭\udc2a\udc38 \udc02𐠢\udc2f𐠍\udc02\udc10𐠏\udc0b\udc33\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc19 \udc0f\ud802𐠊𐠠𐠛\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc34\udc2d\udc22𐠤\udc04\ud802𐠯\udc16𐠣\udc37\udc03𐠼\udc02𐠨𐠋\udc2d\udc3f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc14𐠁𐠄 \ud802\ud802\ud802 </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1373.56,"y":386.27,"cell":32978,"i":336,"name":"Schendern Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༂༐༡༅༶༙༩༧༊ༀ༤༆༹༉༤༁༿༰༈༜༖༁༊༛༉༁༂༮༇༘༆༛༓༊༔༷༯༁༫༙༈༺༳༛༨༮༼༦་༽༬༈༜༜༬ༀ༷༃༔༄༪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":292.86,"y":1069.75,"cell":101045,"i":337,"name":"Misaliate Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከዘየለጠኀደጰረጸጠለጰ ጰመፐተአ ተበበጰለ ተተገሀ ሠ ደተለየወደጰ በፐጠጠፈዘጰረበረየነፐወለጠኀከዐረኀመለሀሠዐወወየገጠዐዐቀፀአሠዘከዐበደመፈፐከ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1097.13,"y":353.3,"cell":26077,"i":338,"name":"Horngen Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢐᢑᠭᡀᠧᠧᢤᡯᡱᡗᡟᠮᢜᠦᡒᠠᢢᡁᢛᠯᢦᠽᡙᡐᢐᡓᡒᢦᡁᡔᡁᢡᢜᠼᠿᡯᡒᠡᢤᡁᡁᡠᡁᡴᡜᠨᠭᡕᠼᠡᢦᢀᡝᡍᠮᠼ᠐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1406.68,"y":527.5,"cell":58163,"i":339,"name":"Schotighaup Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳣ⳹ⲲⳆⳘⲴⳃⳠⳲⳁⲺⲼⳲⳎⳞⲶⳖ ⳈⳤⳘ ⳚⲶ ⳩ⲶⳭⳔⳒⳆⳁⳬ⳪ⳚⳲⳀ⳥⳾ⲲⳔⳲⲺⲼⳫ⳧⳧⳩ⳎⳊ ⳧Ⳡ Ⳉ ⳭⳠⳘ⳹ⳈⲸ ⳜⲲⳐ⳧ⲾⲸ⳪ⳖⳄⳭⲺⳫⲴ⳪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":996.71,"y":446.03,"cell":44566,"i":340,"name":"Northton Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᢛᡀᡐᡍᡮᢢᡆ᠑ᡯᠱᢜᠾᠱᢡᠵᢒᠯᢢᡡᡱᡗᡠᡖᡱᢢ᠑ᡟᢟᠲᠳᢜᡳᠦᡒᠭᡖᢓᠾᢥᢓᠯᠰᠩᠰᢒᢐᡏᢤᡰᢂᠰᡁᢐᠯᡰᢤᢡᢟᢢᢤᠩᠩᠿᡍᢑᢢᠮᡀᢛᠼᡙ᠀ᢡᠰᡜᠰᡗᡳᠵᢂᢋᡯᡔᠱᡎᡰᠦᠠᢥᡠᠲᡓᡎᢒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1520.75,"y":638.93,"cell":71719,"i":341,"name":"Ikh-Zrar Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17\udc08\ud802\ud802𐠋\ud802𐠰\udc29\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠞\ud802𐠃\udc23𐠃\udc29𐠳\ud802 \ud802𐠿𐠐\udc29\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠕\ud802 \udc2f𐠧\udc10𐠫\udc3f𐠢\udc37\ud802𐠜\udc10𐠰\ud802𐠨\udc2e\udc21𐠼𐠏𐠂\udc22\udc26\udc04\udc22\ud802𐠸\udc2b</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":378.7,"y":143.67,"cell":3138,"i":342,"name":"Khalh Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲶⳬⲴⳘⲸⳄⳐⳢⲲ⳩ ⳲⳁⳒⳢⳐⳘ ⳎⳘⲶ ⳹ⲺⳐⳔⳤⲶⲴⲲⳐⳊⳂⳈⳲⳠⲺⳘ⳥ⳲⲲⳖⳜⳂ⳧ⲴⳞ⳧ⳤⳘⳞ ⳎⲺⲼⳊⳃⲸⳀⳊⳭⳌⳎⲾ ⲲⳔⳐⳂⳐ ⳘⳢⳬⳃⲶⲾⲲⳞⳢⳢⳠⳎⲾⳄⳜⳚⲲⲲⳂⳈⲶⳘ⳩⳾</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":439.68,"y":870.66,"cell":83544,"i":343,"name":"Arapinaquri Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲶⳘ ⳹ⳈⲴ Ⳇ⳹ⳎⳢⳞ ⳤⳤ⳹ⳢⳀ  Ⳕ ⲺⳜⳎⳊⳲ Ⳬⳬ Ⳍⳁ⳧⳧Ⲷⳬ ⳄⳌⲲⳁⳄⳤⳤⳔⳐⳤⳢⳁⳤⲾ⳩ⳜⳁⳁⳠ⳹⳪ⳤⳖⳢ⳾ⳲⳫⲴⳭ⳥ⳁⳐⳌⳎ⳥ⳐⳃⳆⳐⳎⳔⳃⳂⳫⳊⳤⳞⳬⳎ⳩ⲴⳎⳬⳢⳄⳚⳖⳀⳚⳞⳫⳭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":296.56,"y":260.19,"cell":13933,"i":344,"name":"Morin Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢁᠯᢜᠱᠻᠦᡆᠳᠦᠩᡔ᠒ᠩᡆᠨᡁᢐᡕᢟᠾ᠐ᠪᡠᡳᠼᠵᠠᢒᠮᢡᡒᡗᢢᡎ᠑ᠾᢓᡎᢂᡓᡮᠿᢠᠩᡱᠿᡳᡀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1549.83,"y":957.26,"cell":92379,"i":345,"name":"Nalia Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡠᡓᠯᢂᠲᠾᠮᡟᡆᠩᠡᠳᡀᡜᡴᠳᢛᠾᠼᡁᢒᡀᡙᡳᠨᠳᡡᡓ᠑ᡐᢓᡔᢡᢤᢋᠲᠽᠰᠯᡠᡙᡞᢋᡟᡰᡲᢜᢓᡲᢐᡕᠼᢠᢞᡀᢒᡍ᠑ᡰᢦᡀᠧ᠑ᡀᠿᡳᢥᢜᠪᢒᡡᡙᡟᡁᢦᠾᢛᡱᠡᡑᡱᠨ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1424.72,"y":869.66,"cell":83586,"i":346,"name":"Paaluhala Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༡༇༉༹༾༔ༀ༳༉༐༮༉༕༾༆༂༓༔༶༳༓༓༔༩༰༡་༦༲༬༒༶༔༆༺༱༩༢༹༕༵༁༒༢༮༔༽༉༠༱༷༾༧༽༐༿༻༰༠༛༼༭༊༂༤༘༂༜༯་༒༈༃༯༢༸༧༰༺༬༜༡༬༯༥༊༁༢༉༼༸༔ༀ༛༭༼༴༣</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":130,"y":925.45,"cell":89020,"i":347,"name":"An Rai An Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༹༆༳༐༭༤༃༊༘༊༒༌༗༷༾༁༠༭༌༒༇༠༆༹༗༙༾༑༊༖༻༱༕༣༃༕ༀ༭༳༹༧༣༁༤༈༢༵༢༔༳༉༕༓༉༠༆་</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":784.29,"y":389.47,"cell":33276,"i":348,"name":"Shunbaram Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༠༷༈༆༊༯༆༬༌༆༵༕༓༱༂༁༺༳༊༗༑༣༈༔༅༷༛༜༹༧༈༯༭༽༃༧༕༾༠༽༰་༸༮༔༴༆༜༷༦༜༢་༡༿༙༐༽༣༣༛༠༵༮༣༸༴</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1646.58,"y":401.42,"cell":35671,"i":349,"name":"Yuethasadress Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༲༣༳༢༿༮་༧༮༰༉༖༷༌༉༳༠༅༚༫༢༩༘༔༰༼༢༗༻༸༢༄༘༱༥༒༰༹༂༡༩༲</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":489.7,"y":1159,"cell":107256,"i":350,"name":"Kirifi Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠮\udc23𐠠\udc26\udc03𐠳\ud802𐠄\udc3c\ud802𐠘\udc38𐠒\udc22\udc33𐠭\udc3f𐠍\udc0c𐠱\ud802𐠃\udc04\udc3f𐠲𐠞\udc13\udc38\ud802 \udc3f\udc0e\udc20\udc38𐠞\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠤\ud802𐠿𐠊𐠭 \udc2d\udc02\udc1f𐠑\udc32𐠓\udc0a\udc02\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠚\udc28\udc17 𐠸\udc0d\udc01</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":482.77,"y":1093.83,"cell":102991,"i":351,"name":"Machalin Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠨᢑ᠀ᡞᡎᠡᡕᡱᡀᢒᠧᢤᢡᠾᠩᢠᡕᢐᢦᢡᢂ᠀ᡝᡑᢑᡍᡒᢁᢒ᠀ᡡᠠᡰᠮᠽᢑᠠᠭᠱᢦ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":999.03,"y":474.62,"cell":50002,"i":352,"name":"Lindokeso Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17\ud802 𐠼\udc05\ud802\ud802 𐠋𐠢 \ud802\ud802𐠪\udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc12\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc27\udc02\ud802𐠿\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛\udc31\udc04\udc29𐠌\ud802\ud802𐠪\udc17\ud802𐠠𐠨\udc22 \udc32\ud802 𐠌𐠲\udc25\udc0d\udc31𐠪𐠳𐠊\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc08\udc0a\udc2a\ud802𐠳𐠌\ud802 𐠩\udc38</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":885.4,"y":270,"cell":14935,"i":353,"name":"Bopolch Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸወ ወጠጰከዘዐመበሰጸዘጠሠአረጸጸነሠደኀደጸደኀየፈወሐወ ፐአሠደገቀቀደ ዐገለኀዐሠዐሠወዐጸሰ የፐተበፈተጠበመዘ ነረበዐፐረ ኀሀሰ ሐሠፐከደፐሀገጠገለገፐየዘዘ ለዐጰወነ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":406.34,"y":934.4,"cell":89840,"i":354,"name":"Alnalar Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༽༉༫༺༊༴༧༤༛༱༹༺༴༩༭༒༢༧༙༃༩༯༹༗༌༐༠༽༡༗༡༾༾༶༐༫༆༽༾༗</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":607.72,"y":1063.27,"cell":100593,"i":355,"name":"Kudali Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢜᢡᡰᡴᠱᠦᡮᢥᢢᠠᠿᢏᡒᡞᡑᢁᡠᠡᡓ᠀᠐ᡎᠻ᠒ᢏᢑᡔᠧᢤᠽᡏᡴᠽᢠᠮᠻᠳᡎᡒᡔᠲᠾᠯᡭᡔᡀᢒᢒᠪᠩᢂᡟ᠒ᠱᠨᡱᠭᠲᠲᢟᠱᠿᢜᢁᡭᠲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":502.06,"y":856.21,"cell":82136,"i":356,"name":"Nigrum Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠦᡠᡠᠲᡒᡜᡳᢁᠱ᠒ᠱᡞᠰᡆᡕᡏᢞᢐᡏᢡᠲᢀᡱᢜᡍᡭᡆᡟᢑᢓᡑᡮᡑᢐᡆ᠀᠒ᡑᡑᡴᢤᠼᡗᡱᡗ᠒ᢒᢜᠯᡖᠰᡯᠩᠽᠪᢦᡲᢟ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":476.6,"y":407.83,"cell":36951,"i":357,"name":"Adong Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢏ᠀ᢓᡯᢏᠵᠼᡮᢥᠯᡳᡍᡑ᠐ᠳᢟᠠᡲᢞᢑᡎᠨᡔᢑᡑ᠐ᢡᡎᡁ᠀ᡯᡑᡒᢜᡕᡠᡰᠼᡑᡗᠼᡒᠼᡭᠧᠼᢓᢛᢀᡒᠵᠿᢂᢓᢓ᠐ᡱᡓᡎᢛᢐᠡᢟᢤᡱᢦᠼᢑᢜᡱᠧᠡᡮᡳᢟᡔᡎᡁᡱᡕ᠑ᢐᡝᢠᡳᠮᠨᢓᠼᢓᢦᡎᠲᡠᡐᢑᡰᢜ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1233.29,"y":130.03,"cell":2194,"i":358,"name":"Oralen Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠏\ud802\ud802 𐠤\ud802𐠦𐠍\udc2f\udc0e\udc2d𐠅\udc26\ud802\ud802𐠄𐠊𐠰\udc13\ud802\ud802𐠍𐠣\ud802𐠟𐠃\udc0a\ud802𐠢\udc17\ud802 \udc0a\udc13\ud802𐠏\udc35\udc1f𐠷\udc0b\udc24 𐠪 𐠗\udc01𐠂\udc02\ud802𐠷𐠌𐠣 \udc1a \udc30 \udc20𐠔𐠷𐠔\udc2f\udc04\ud802 𐠤\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":411.22,"y":1118.45,"cell":104668,"i":359,"name":"Kalgramna Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲳ⳾ⳁⳬ ⲼⳢⳚ ⳹ⳐⳐⳭ Ⳳ ⳂⳤⲴⳫ ⳒⳫⲶⳃⲲⳫⳐ⳾ⳀⳠⲼⳤⳊⳁ⳪ⳲⳌⲸⳚⲾⲸⲾⲶ ⳊⳘⳭⳒⳂⳜ ⲾⳌ ⳂⲸⳢ⳪ⲼⳌ⳧⳧ ⳢⲸⳊⳁ ⲴⲸⳜⳘⳢ ⲲⳈ⳥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":428.66,"y":882.4,"cell":85006,"i":360,"name":"Yaar Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༧༑༭༆༼༒༄༷༫༄༩༸༻༖༔༕༒༡༁ༀ༳༹༹༿༳༗༡༇༺༐ༀ༊ༀ༑༸༇༤༶༉༽༙༠༲༼༚༳༜༜༛༪༅༼ༀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":336.5,"y":369.27,"cell":28966,"i":361,"name":"Chaipoming Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳚⳈ ⳢⳫⳲⳈⲶⳂⳬ⳾ⳖⳘⲶⳆ⳹ⲶⳚⳄⳠⳈ⳪⳥Ⲹ ⳬⲶⳀⳆⳭⳎⳆ⳥ⳃⳘⲺⲴⳞⲸⳭⳬⳂ⳧ⳀⲶⳔⳎⳃⲶ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1498.47,"y":388.82,"cell":33546,"i":362,"name":"Chagheiz'rau Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገአዘበፈቀጠ ኀረሀአገጠ  ጠረ ሠመ ተሰለረፈተ  አየሐኀገመዘኀገበቀሠ ሠ ጰደለተነፈገጸሰ ከ ሠ ተ ፀሰገከጸፀጰአሰገዐሰፈወጰጠአመዐቀጰሀሰፀፈተሀዐዐነ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1343.21,"y":343.61,"cell":24592,"i":363,"name":"Horisch Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༜༷༶༷༶༐༲༻༘༷༔༴༶༣༲༑༁༅༦༗༖༌༼༥༢༗༴༼ༀ༳༒༼༦༢༬༣༖༩༑༷༻༁ༀ༉༽༈༄༇༜༣ༀ༢༮༯༰༔༘༣༾ༀ༬༃༨༙༗༚༈༅༯༿༨༥༬༺༱༳༮༈༳༅༄༥༢༨༖༻༘༊༉༠ༀ༇༆༁</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":931.1,"y":294.4,"cell":17595,"i":364,"name":"Vorod Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢋᡎᡮᢢᡔᠯᡰᡑ᠀ᡲᡓᡀᡓᢤᡒᡝᠾᢋᡗᢠᠯᡳᢁᡡᠻᡜᢐᢋᡑᡠᡯᡑᢛᡳᡡᢦᡟᢀᠨᡡᡓ᠀ᢐᢦᢑᠼᢀᢓᢟᠨᡏᡐᡀᠮᢦᡓᠰ᠒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":666.46,"y":1079.02,"cell":101827,"i":365,"name":"Masayu Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪ⳜⳌⳐ ⳩ⳆⳌⳒ⳩ⳚⳫⳃⳃⳆⳎⳊⳐ ⳄⳒⲲⳃⳒⳠⳘⲺⳎ ⳃ ⳃⳁⳭⳊⳃ ⳄⳀⲸⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":866.54,"y":322.93,"cell":20904,"i":366,"name":"Framping Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༙༙༼༼༰༦༳༕༩༃༪༘༫༈༴༻༆༾༠༲་༇༣༼༸༙༚༆༚༃༂༻༬༨༡༿༰༻༅༱༯༌༨༻༊༴༓༅༜༴༽</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":342.87,"y":398.78,"cell":34724,"i":367,"name":"Yongshan Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳗ Ⳅ⳩ⳊⳄⳂⳄⳌⳬⳔ Ⳣ⳪Ⲵ⳥ⳆⳠⲸ⳾⳪ⳢⳎⳲ⳪⳹ⳭⳐ Ⲵ⳧ⳐⳂⳢⳄⳔ ⳌⳠⳔⳭⳁⳠⲸⳎⳌⲺⲾⳬⳀⳬⳐⲾⳠⳫ⳾Ⳡ ⳔⳘⳆⳈⲴⳄⳐⳒⳚⳤ⳥ⳊⳢⳃⳀⳄⳀ⳹ⳞⳞ⳪ⳈⲼⳄⳌ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":328.96,"y":208.14,"cell":9341,"i":368,"name":"Baatservi Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢀᢦᡲᠻᡙᡞᡲᠾᠼᠡᢂᠳᢛᠼᡓᠰᡭᠡᡗᢦᢤᠽᡏᡴᢑᢀᡐᢁᢦᢢᡐᢀᢁᠦᡑᢛᢑᠰᠩᢑᢓᠮᠮᡖᡔᠩ᠒ᡲᠯᢟᠧᡜᢁᢜᢓᡏ᠐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":418.76,"y":1035.95,"cell":98900,"i":369,"name":"Hapuledgir Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸተሐደረፈሀነአ  የጠለዘነአሐከየረዐፀፈየጠመ ጸአለጸበሰሀሰለፀነዐ  ሠ ሠነደደሠፈ ነከዘፀጠፈገ አተፈጸከአዐቀገዘለበፐ አ ወሠነ መፀጸየ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1523.63,"y":344.83,"cell":24663,"i":370,"name":"Vhalthel'rau Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠒ᡱ᠑ᢓᢞᠩᢥᠽᢓᠲᡕᠱᢛᢀᡯᠧ᠑ᡳᢐᡰᡏᡕᢠᠩᠩᠾᠽ᠐ᢥᡗᠿᡒᡖᡲᢦᡡᢓᡒᡭᢥᠼᡴᠽᡁᡙᢂᢁᡰᢐᢂᡗ᠒᠒ᢥᢤᠻ᠐ᡀᡓᡁᠱᢓᠽ᠒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":136.9,"y":471.4,"cell":48820,"i":371,"name":"Yoshizuda Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༧༪༳༭༧༅༉༄༁༥༷༠༦༇༂༽༐༆༊༉༦༣༓༩༁༘༪༻༿༨༆༵༐༽༲༰༸༇༹༈༻༬༩༡༺༔༃༱༽༥༴༐༽༱༃༹༲༄༪༫༔༖ༀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1603.3,"y":872.89,"cell":83964,"i":372,"name":"Ponoulueo Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢒᡏᡒᠲᢁᡒᢀᡲᢐᢢᡟᠩᢓᠭᢠᡎᢦᢡᢓᡡᠿᡞᢓᢥ᠒ᡎᢛᠮᢓᢦᠾᡭᡯᡝᠭᡡᡞᡳᡗᡴᢡᡡᠭᡞᠦ᠐ᠾ᠒ᡖᡰ᠐ᡓᠵᢋᢏᡁᡏᢤᢜᡁᡐᡔᠦᠻᠧᠮᢦᠲᡞᠱᠽᢥᡔ᠐ᢑᠩᢟᢒᢦᢂᠾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":297.35,"y":976.36,"cell":94227,"i":373,"name":"Indyrfantob Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༄༸༗༴༿༖༛༰༇༇༥༣༙༬༜༮༢༠༄༂༱༇༂༵༺༲༡༕༚༢༭༫༔༆༯༄༒༺༾༫༱༪༼༠༒༅༐༮ༀ༑༹༶༐༢་༖༄༠༸༁༵༾༭༧༙</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":984.76,"y":395.33,"cell":34380,"i":374,"name":"Meschka Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲸⳭⳘⳤⳆⳔ⳾ⳞⳈⳐ ⳧ⳜⲲⳘⲲⳬ⳾⳩⳧⳹ⲸⲼⳌⳀⲸⳀⳆⲺⳢⳂⳢⳫⲲⲸ⳪Ⳍ⳾Ⲻ⳹Ⳟ⳩ⳫⳂⳎ⳧ⳈⳭⳃⳠⲾⲸ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":806.28,"y":700.53,"cell":76131,"i":375,"name":"Stryt Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳜⲾ⳾Ⳉ⳹ⳎⳆⳂ⳪Ⳓⳁ⳥Ⲳ⳩ⳃⳃ ⳊⲶⳖⳀ⳩ⲺⳆⲲ ⳾ⳁⲴⳬⳖⳠⳃⳆ⳪⳾ⳃⳖⳫⳫⲲ⳹ⳤⳤⲸⳞ ⳐⲾⳀⳲⲸⳐⳜ⳾ⳌⲾⳆⳐⲲⳌⲺⳈⳌ⳧ⳊⲶⳆⲼ⳧ⳌⳲⲼⳊⲾⳜ ⲼⳞⲾⳜⳞ⳥ⳤⳤⳠⳃⳀ⳥ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":356.11,"y":784.9,"cell":78308,"i":376,"name":"Stamsda Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተገሐሀሰሰከጸገኀረሐሰመሀወፀሀዘፐፐነሐሰ ነ ፈተቀወፈሀኀነሰከበሐገጰየመጰ አመበአኀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":412.39,"y":470.74,"cell":48926,"i":377,"name":"Hangsaiwan Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በፀዐየዐፈፈጠደአሐከደሰሰከአሰጠበከ ጸነጠደ ተቀኀ መሠዘፐተዐዐመአፈ ፀቀሀፀዘፀገከረአበ የገዘየሰከ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1731.88,"y":455.76,"cell":46860,"i":378,"name":"Noladrinn Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢂᡠᡠᢒᡭᠰᡳᢏᢢᡯᡡᡡᡑᡐᢤᡑᡎ᠐ᠲᡟ᠑ᡀᢐᡭᡁᠿᢦᠻᢟᡁᡡᢒᢁᠲᡝ᠒ᠧᡟᠽᠠᠠᡏᠿᠦᠵᠪᡓᠩᡎᡡᢀᡀᡳᢛ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":440.39,"y":357.94,"cell":26903,"i":379,"name":"Deganam Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᡰᢟᠲᡰᠯ᠀᠑ᠦᠻᠱᠼᡔᢜᡱᠡᠮᡒᡙᠱᠽ᠐ᡜᢑ᠀ᠰᡱᢟᡍ᠐ᡴᢦᢋᢀᡝᡕ᠀ᠳᡭᡭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":484.86,"y":867.85,"cell":83265,"i":380,"name":"Durilacisio Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠓𐠬\ud802𐠓𐠫\udc34\udc21\udc35\ud802𐠢\ud802𐠈\udc1e\udc21𐠋\udc1b\udc18\ud802\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠫\udc0b𐠼\ud802𐠃𐠫𐠨𐠬\ud802𐠢𐠱\u